# STRAT-002: Company OKRs Q1 2024

**Document ID:** STRAT-002
**Company:** MedSync Health
**Period:** Q1 2024 (January 1 - March 31)
**Author:** Manus AI
**Date:** January 17, 2026

## Executive Summary

The Q1 2024 Company Objectives and Key Results (OKRs) are strategically aligned with the annual financial plan (See FIN-001 for full financial targets) and the preparation for the upcoming Series D funding round in June 2024. The primary focus for the quarter is aggressive revenue growth, particularly in the North American and EMEA regions, coupled with a strong emphasis on customer retention and operational scaling to support the planned headcount increase.

These OKRs are designed to ensure MedSync Health achieves the planned **AED 110,250,000** in Q1 revenue and maintains a strong operational foundation as we scale the team to **1,120** employees by the end of the quarter [1].

