## Company Objectives and Key Results (Q1 2024)

### Objective 1: Achieve Aggressive Q1 Financial Targets and Improve Margin Profile

This objective ensures we hit our quarterly revenue goals and maintain fiscal discipline, which is critical for our Series D valuation.

