| Key Result (KR) | Metric | Target | Status |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| **KR 2.1 (Retention)** | Maintain Net Revenue Retention (NRR) at or above | **118%** | To Do |
| **KR 2.2 (Satisfaction)** | Increase Overall Company NPS from 71 to | **73** | To Do |
| **KR 2.3 (Adoption)** | Increase the number of hospitals using 3+ MedSync products by | **15%** | To Do |
